<section class="why-section anim-rise delay-5">
  <span class="section-label">A note on the approach</span>
  <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
  <span class="accent-line"></span>
  <p>
    I only really understand something once I try to explain it or build it, and
    usually discover, halfway through, that I didn't understand it at all. So this
    is where both threads end up: projects alongside notes, each filling the gaps
    the other leaves behind. Nothing here is meant to be authoritative. It's one
    person's attempt to make sense of things, out in the open.
  </p>
</section>

